  << /ActualText (Senior Engineer\015\050Oct 2022 \055 Apr 2026\051\nDesigned\054 implemented\054 and migrated a usage\055based\054 stats\055driven billing application\054 dramatically simplifying billing for a new product\056 \nStreamlined processes to reduce manual work and improve accuracy in billing operations\056\nServed as acting tech lead for the Finance Engineering team\054 mentoring other engineers\056)
