1188 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Principal Engineer \050Oct 2020 \055 Oct 2022\051\nDesigned and deployed a distributed messaging queue system for cross\055service communication\054 usage aggregation\054 and stats collection\056 \nReplaced a legacy billing platform with a third\055party solution while maintaining all core user features\056 \nEnabled near real\055time billing and reduced new product billing implementations to configuration\055only\056 \nBuilt tools that allowed finance teams to manage billing configuration independently\056\n\nEngineering Manager \050Oct 2019 \055 Oct 2020\051\nManaged the Data Insights engineering team responsible for data acquisition and delivery\054 with emphasis on usage aggregation for billing\056 \nLed cross\055team integrations of new and existing data into reports and billing applications\056\n\nSenior Engineer\015\050Jan 2017 \055 Oct 2020\051\nDeveloped platform and API services in Ruby supporting Fastly\031s scaling infrastructure\056\n\nEngineer\015\050Oct 2013 \055 Jan 2017\051)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 1189 0 R
